<title>UK: Montreal sets 110 million mark seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Montreal sets 110 million mark seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF MONTREAL</p>
<p> AMT    110 MLN DEM   SPREAD     +15 BP    MATURITY    16.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  ISS PRICE  99.98     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    FRFT	DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     LIST	  5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
